
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Royal Bites Restaurant</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #fffaf2;
  color: #292016;
}

header {
  background: #302015;
  color: white;
  padding: 22px;
  text-align: center;
}

.hero {
  padding: 90px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  background: #8b451f;
  color: white;
}

.hero h2 {
  font-size: 42px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 25px;
  padding: 14px 25px;
  background: #f5b942;
  color: #302015;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

section {
  padding: 55px 20px;
  text-align: center;
}

.menu {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns:
    repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  gap: 20px;
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 30px auto;
}

.food {
  background: white;
  padding: 30px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #0001;
}

footer {
  background: #302015;
  color: white;
  padding: 25px;
  text-align: center;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>ROYAL BITES</h1>
  <p>Delicious Food. Beautiful Moments.</p>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <h2>Welcome to Royal Bites</h2>
  <p>Experience delicious meals made with love.</p>
  <a href="#menu" class="btn">Explore Our Menu</a>
</div>

<section id="menu">
  <h2>Our Menu</h2>

  <div class="menu">
    <div class="food">
      <h3>🍔 Classic Burger</h3>
      <p>KSh 450</p>
    </div>

    <div class="food">
      <h3>🍕 Special Pizza</h3>
      <p>KSh 850</p>
    </div>

    <div class="food">
      <h3>🍗 Grilled Chicken</h3>
      <p>KSh 700</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Visit Us</h2>
  <p>Fresh food, friendly service and great experiences.</p>
  <a href="https://wa.me/254141921546"
     class="btn">Order on WhatsApp</a>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>© 2026 Royal Bites Restaurant</p>
  <p>Demonstration website by TradeZone Digital</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
